<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#E5C07B;">   -</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> Key: Phonon BTE under Callaway&#39;s dual relaxation model (N-scattering vs. R-scattering); Local Spatial Linear Approximation (LSLA); T-shaped graphene micro-ribbons (w=1-2 μm); thermal rectification ratio up to ~16%; ZA phonons dominate; direction-dependent thermal resistance; boundary roughness (specularity coefficient β); hydrodynamic window where Λ_N ≪ L ≪ Λ_R.</span></span>
